    {
      "text": "Spirit of God moved upon the face of the waters, Gen. 1:2 (Moses 2:2). Spirit of the Lord began to move him, Judg. 13:25. foundations of heaven moved, 2 Sam. 22:8 (Ps. 18:7). Lord … at my right hand, I shall not be moved, Ps. 16:8 (Acts 2:25). foundations … of the hills moved and were shaken, Ps. 18:7. through the mercy of the most High he shall not be moved, Ps. 21:7. he shall never suffer the righteous to be moved, Ps. 55:22. root of the righteous shall not be moved, Prov. 12:3. earth is moved exceedingly, Isa. 24:19.",
